{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/1fc7ec97b5a693b2dc7448c20701381a.poster.avif?t=1764699508\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/1fc7ec97b5a693b2dc7448c20701381a.webm?t=1764699508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/1fc7ec97b5a693b2dc7448c20701381a.mp4?t=1764699508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bend Time. Defeat Enemies. Save Your Sister.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling action platformer, you play as adam, a relentless hero on a desperate mission to rescue his sister nora.  you\u2019ll battle through waves of ruthless enemies and treacherous environments in a race against fate.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master precision combat as you shoot, dash, and parry. And when you're overwhelmed, slow the world around you to dodge bullets,  and strike with surgical accuracy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rooftops to underground laboratories, every level pushes your reflexes and tactical thinking to the limit. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is your enemy, but time is your weapon. Can you beat both?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/ec08d87da80be7305aa21715cc29355f.poster.avif?t=1764699508\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/ec08d87da80be7305aa21715cc29355f.webm?t=1764699508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/ec08d87da80be7305aa21715cc29355f.mp4?t=1764699508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move like lightning and stay one step ahead with a fluid, momentum driven dash mechanic that keeps combat fast and dynamic. Use your dash to evade enemy attacks, cross deadly gaps, or close the distance in an instant for a brutal takedown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/5791749877ba37bc0f21419e1e63ebd4.poster.avif?t=1764699508\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/5791749877ba37bc0f21419e1e63ebd4.webm?t=1764699508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/extras/5791749877ba37bc0f21419e1e63ebd4.mp4?t=1764699508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909340?t=1764699508","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909340?t=1764699508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/77d00bb09ec0ca9da922612e41c8df999998a8ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764699508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909340/77d00bb09ec0ca9da922612e41c8df999998a8ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764699508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"blood is heavily used in the game!\r\nfor example: when yo